# Phase 9:  Century Scenario Simulator     -> v13_century_scenarios.json
# Phase 10: Civilization Dashboard         -> v13_dashboard.json
#
# Reads: v1..v12 outputs (read-only).
# Writes: v13_* only.  V1-V12 NEVER modified.
